 "summary": "A single green surface-mount LED in an 0805 body, 2.0 by 1.25 mm and 0.85 mm high, with a clear flat lens. At 5 mA its dominant wavelength falls between 513 and 528 nm and its luminous intensity between 175 and 430 mcd, over a 120° viewing angle, with a forward voltage of 2.6 to 3.1 V. It takes 30 mA continuous, 60 mA in short pulses and 5 V of reverse bias, and comes 3000 to a reel of 8 mm tape.",
